BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Canada Day Film: Long Time Running (2017)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260703T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260703T193000
UID:69fd1f57c7d3cd580057c19d@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:This film documents The Tragically Hip's legendary 2016 tour\,
  from emotional lead up through to the epic last show. Celebrate one of th
 e greatest musicians Canada has ever produced\, ten years after millions c
 ame together to honour his legacy one final time. This is the third instal
 lment of our monthly Canadian movie series.\nFilm will be shown with close
 d captions.\nLight refreshments will be served or feel free to bring your 
 own!\nRated PG.
LOCATION:Pape/Danforth\, Second floor program room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69fd1f57c7d3cd580057c19d
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Young Adults
END:VEVENT
